    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "06bc65ab-a293-4213-8c6b-36943809c24e",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Deathkneel to the Carlisles",
        "Location": "LOCATION_ANCESTRAL_BULLDOG",
        "PublicId": "128893070314",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Ancestral/scene_bulldog.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 02bdd2c2-4311-4d62-a699-fa4ee07fc55f).Image",
        "Description": "Removing the head is usually  enough to kill the body, but it seems like in this case the corpse is still walking. The Carlisles are back at it again, and this time we need to end them for good. But be discreet, they are on high alert after the passing of their matriarch Alexa, and it&apos;s adivsed to eliminate the family through accidents, and different ones at that. Maybe you could get closer to them by infiltrating the staff, but the end result is, as usual, up to you. \r\rGood luck, 47.",
